---
description: Supabase integration rules (only when requested)
alwaysApply: true
---

Supabase rules:
- Only implement Supabase access when explicitly requested.
- Put reusable data access helpers in lib/ (e.g., lib/supabase/*.ts or lib/db/*.ts).
- Do not embed raw queries directly inside JSX render blocks.
- Keep UI and data access separated (page/component calls helper functions).
- Never print or request environment secrets.

